1
00:00:00,433 --> 00:00:01,633
(Leonard:)In my head.

2
00:00:01,634 --> 00:00:03,304
(chuckles)

3
00:00:03,303 --> 00:00:05,933
(Leonard:)On the way home.

4
00:00:05,939 --> 00:00:07,839
(Leonard:)While I was having a good cry.

5
00:00:12,445 --> 00:00:14,645
(knocking on door)

6
00:00:14,647 --> 00:00:16,017
(Amy:)Sheldon, can I come in?

7
00:00:16,015 --> 00:00:18,145
(Sheldon:)I don't think
that's a good idea.

8
00:00:18,151 --> 00:00:19,551
(Amy:)Why not?

9
00:00:19,552 --> 00:00:21,622
(Sheldon:)According to an online
message board,

10
00:00:21,621 --> 00:00:23,891
(Sheldon:)I may be having a panic attack.

11
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:25,960
(Sheldon:)SoccerMom09 had
similar symptoms.

12
00:00:27,994 --> 00:00:31,994
(Sheldon:)But to be fair, the twins were
a real handful that day.

13
00:00:31,998 --> 00:00:33,468
(Amy:)You're making me worry.

14
00:00:33,466 --> 00:00:34,666
(Amy:)What's going on?

15
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:38,637
(Sheldon:)What's going on is we're
about to go to a prom.

16
00:00:38,638 --> 00:00:39,838
(Sheldon:)And there's
a great deal of pressure

17
00:00:39,839 --> 00:00:41,839
(Sheldon:)on young couples
like us to engage in

18
00:00:41,841 --> 00:00:45,911
(Sheldon:)what Mr. Bob Eubanks
called making whoopee.

19
00:00:45,912 --> 00:00:47,812
(Amy:)What pressure?

20
00:00:47,814 --> 00:00:49,484
(Amy:)All I said was
you look handsome.

21
00:00:49,482 --> 00:00:52,082
(Amy:)Can you please
open the door?

22
00:00:52,085 --> 00:00:53,985
(Sheldon:)It's not just that.

23
00:00:53,987 --> 00:00:56,587
(Sheldon:)Leonard and Penny also
made comments about it.

24
00:00:56,589 --> 00:00:58,219
(Sheldon:)And I'm not blind.

25
00:00:58,224 --> 00:01:00,854
(Sheldon:)Even I looked twice
when I saw my posterior

